<BaseLayout title="About — Ziye Li" description="About Ziye Li: robotics, ML, cloud, and embedded engineering.">
  <section class="space-y-4">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-4xl">About</h1>
    <p class="max-w-2xl text-base text-slate-300 md:text-lg">
      I'm an engineer working across robotics, machine learning, cloud infrastructure, and
      embedded systems. This site is a living portfolio of my work: experiments, production
      systems, and technical deep dives.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
